# [[ .Name ]]-qua

The contract between the quanar and its quans. It holds no behaviour: the
quanar implements `QuanarCore` and plugs it in with `init()`; quans call the
functions below and never see the quanar itself.

| Call | Answered by the quanar with |
| --- | --- |
| `http.get/post/put/patch/delete(url, body)` | a request to the server through the quanar's axios client, with the user's token |
| `increment(value)` | `value + 1` |
| `getUser()` | the signed-in user and their permissions |
| `hasPermission(name)` | whether that user has the permission |
| `navigate(path)` | a move inside the quanar's router |
| `notify(message, kind)` | a toast in the quanar |
